  <article class="post">
    <p class="lede">On November 6–7, 2026, TeamBotics tested the hiring chatbots at <strong>64 employers</strong> — live, from the candidate's chair, asking each one the same eight questions a job-seeker would ask. Thirty-two of the assistants were confirmed deployments of one vendor: <strong>Paradox</strong>, now Workday's Candidate Experience Agent. We scored <strong>247 answers</strong>.</p>

    <p class="thesis">247 tests. 32 deployments. 3 passes.<br />Don't send a chatbot to do a form's work.</p>

    <div class="stats">
