    <h2 class="sec">The six findings</h2>
    <p class="evidence-note">The screenshots on this page are evidence, not illustration. Click any frame to view the original capture at full size.</p>

    <section class="finding">
      <h3>F1 — The assistant would not describe the job</h3>
      <p>In 32 confirmed deployments, <strong>not one assistant described the role it was attached to</strong> — the role named in the live posting on the same page. Questions about duties and skills were deflected to the careers page, the posting text, or a request to restate the question.</p>
