      <p>It appears three times in that session, and the same deployment's job search briefly rendered “Lorem ipsum” placeholder lines. At Crocs, two questions went unanswered for over a minute and a reload <strong>lost the conversation entirely</strong>. At Pfizer, one question was never answered at all and another took about 30 seconds.</p>
